{"generalSituation":"Under the persistent influence of a broad trough of low pressure, showers will still be heavy with squally thunderstorms over the coast of southern China tomorrow. With the broad trough of low pressure weakening gradually in the following couple of days, the weather will become bright over the coast of Guangdong, but there will still be showers. Besides, the tropical cyclone over the seas east of the Philippines will move towards the vicinity of Luzon and linger over the region in the next couple of days. Meanwhile, Tropical Cyclone Dolphin over the western North Pacific will move towards the seas south of Japan, then with a higher chance of edging closer to the vicinity of the East China Sea in the latter part of this week. Its outer subsiding air will bring very hot weather to the coast of southeastern China. High temperatures will also trigger thundery showers.","weatherForecast":[{"forecastDate":"20260803","week":"Monday","forecastWind":"South to southeast force 3 to 4, force 5 offshore at first.","forecastWeather":"Mainly cloudy with occasional showers and thunderstorms. Showers will be heavy at times at first.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":28,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":25,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":95,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":75,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":63,"PSR":"High"},{"forecastDate":"20260804","week":"Tuesday","forecastWind":"Southeast force 2 to 3.","forecastWeather":"Mainly cloudy with a few showers. More showers with thunderstorms at first.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":30,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":25,"unit":"C"},"forecastMaxrh":{"value":95,"unit":"percent"},"forecastMinrh":{"value":70,"unit":"percent"},"ForecastIcon":62,"PSR":"Medium High"},{"forecastDate":"20260805","week":"Wednesday","forecastWind":"Light winds force 2.","forecastWeather":"Mainly cloudy with a few showers. Sunny intervals during the day.","forecastMaxtemp":{"value":31,"unit":"C"},"forecastMintemp":{"value":2